♪ I pulled myself into
that River Thames, yeah...

774
00:50:39,746 --> 00:50:40,830
[meows]

775
00:50:40,913 --> 00:50:43,833
[captain] For action
above and beyond the call of duty,

776
00:50:43,916 --> 00:50:47,712
it is my honor to present Tamara Green

777
00:50:47,795 --> 00:50:49,881
with the Philadelphia Police Department's

778
00:50:49,964 --> 00:50:54,635
Sergeant Robert Wilson III
Medal of Valor.

779
00:50:54,719 --> 00:50:57,346
[applause]

780
00:50:58,139 --> 00:51:00,266
It is also my great privilege

781
00:51:00,349 --> 00:51:03,144
to immediately reassign you
to Detective,

782
00:51:03,227 --> 00:51:04,979
Homicide Division.

783
00:51:08,566 --> 00:51:11,027
[cheering]

784
00:51:11,110 --> 00:51:13,237
She deserves it, you know? About time.

785
00:51:13,321 --> 00:51:14,489
Finally.

786
00:51:14,572 --> 00:51:17,241
♪ sweet surrender...

787
00:51:17,325 --> 00:51:18,409
[commander] Fire!

788
00:51:18,493 --> 00:51:20,578
Ready! Aim!

789
00:51:20,661 --> 00:51:21,662
Fire!

790
00:51:21,746 --> 00:51:23,247
♪ we meet again ♪

791
00:51:26,209 --> 00:51:29,670
♪ Until we meet again ♪

792
00:51:32,340 --> 00:51:36,093
♪ Until we meet again ♪

793
00:51:38,888 --> 00:51:40,765
Whiz Wit.

794
